  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 " (",
 StyleBox["\[Nu]",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 " and D are references). Its flow is purely canonical, because ",
 StyleBox["\[Lambda]",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 " is not renormalised (lesson 06):"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"217321f2-5ef1-497a-ae10-ed7b495025ef"],

Cell["ShowBeta[adim, lamk]", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"d1dad59e-02f3-419d-9368-76a20f761575"],

Cell[TextData[{
